comment
Effects
* Satie has a Delay, Reverb, LPF, BPF, HPF
endcomment

loop water/1
    volume goto(0and.2 in 0.5)
    filter mode lowpass cutoff gobetween(300and3000 in 15)

oneshot bicycle/1to10 every 1to1.5
    volume gobetween(0and.2 in 20)
    randomstart
    delay wet 0.9 time 0.5to0.9 feedback 0.2to1
    reverb wet gobetween(0.1and1 in 10) size 0.8
    move fly
    visual trail and sphere
    color red 255 green 0 blue gobetween(0and200 in 5)

